# =============================================================================
# VERCEL — čist reset varijabli za upitnik (Resend)  [korak po korak]
# =============================================================================
# 0) U Vercelu otvorite PROJEKAT na kojem pod Settings → Domains stoji
#    www.operonixindustrial.com  (ne mora se zvati v0-…; bitno je DOMENA).
#
# 1) Settings → Environment Variables → obrišite SVE sljedeće koje postoje
#    (i duplikate / pogrešna imena):
#    - RESEND_API_KEY
#    - RESEND_FROM
#    - ASSESSMENT_TO_EMAIL
#    - ASSESMENT_TO_EMAIL   (pogrešno pravopis—ako ste ga slučajno dodali)
#    - WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY (samo ako NE koristite Web3Forms)
#    - OPERONIX_QUOTE_FUNCTION_URL  (samo ako NE koristite Firebase ingest)
#    - OPERONIX_QUOTE_INGEST_SECRET (isto)
#
# 2) Add Environment Variable — dodajte TAČNO TRI (kopirajte IMENA slovom u slovu):
#
#    Ime:   RESEND_API_KEY
#    Value: (iz Resend → API ključevi, cijeli ključ re_… , bez razmaka, bez navodnika)
#    Okruženje: Production + Preview
#
#    Ime:   RESEND_FROM
#    Value: Operonix <info@operonixindustrial.com>
#           (adresa MORA biti @ domene verifikovane u Resendu; može i druga npr. noreply@…)
#    Okruženje: Production + Preview
#
#    Ime:   ASSESSMENT_TO_EMAIL
#    Value: info@operonixindustrial.com,nuhanovic.mirza86@gmail.com
#           (zarez između; bez razmaka OK; jedan red)
#    Okruženje: Production + Preview
#
# 3) Deployments → najnoviji Production (Latest) → ⋯ → Redeploy
#    (ne Redeploy starog commita kad Vercel kaže da postoji noviji.)
#
# 4) Provjera u pregledniku (isti runtime kao forma):
#    https://www.operonixindustrial.com/api/assessment-submit
#    U JSONu mora biti checks.hasResendApiKey / hasResendFrom / hasAssessmentToEmail svi true.
# =============================================================================

# --- ispod: primjer istih vrijednosti za lokalni .env.local (ne commitajte tajne) ---

RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM=Operonix <info@operonixindustrial.com>
ASSESSMENT_TO_EMAIL=info@operonixindustrial.com,nuhanovic.mirza86@gmail.com

# --- opcionalno: Firebase ingest (samo ako ga stvarno koristite na Vercelu) ---
OPERONIX_QUOTE_FUNCTION_URL=
OPERONIX_QUOTE_INGEST_SECRET=

# --- opcionalno: Web3Forms umjesto Resend ---
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
